<title>USA: Chart Industries sees same sales level ahead.</title>
<headline>Chart Industries sees same sales level ahead.</headline>
<dateline>EASTLAKE, Ohio 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter Industries Inc said Monday that it expects to continue posting current levels of sales and profitability for the rest of 1996 and into 1997.</p>
<p>For the third quarter ended September 30, the company reported net income of $3.8 million, or $0.38 per share, on sales of $37.9 million.  In the prior year's third quarter, the company reported net income of $2.1 million, or $0.20, on sales of $26.7 million.</p>
<p>Charter Industries manufactures standard and custom-built industrial process equipment.</p>
</text>
